                            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-text-primary">Senior Agile Coach</h3>
                            <span class="font-code-sm text-code-sm text-text-muted">2019 — 2026</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-muted mb-4">Agile by Design • Toronto, Canada</div>
                        <div class="bg-surface-subtle p-5 rounded-lg mb-6">
                            <span class="font-code-sm text-[0.7rem] text-accent-flow uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold block mb-1">Consultancy Context</span>
                            <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
                                Agile by Design is a premier boutique delivery consultancy embedding transformation leads directly inside enterprises to revamp operating models, turn around $100M+ programs, and generate 10× delivery-frequency improvements. Led by Jeff Anderson, a published author and frequent speaker on modern Agile and AI practice.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <p class="font-body-lead text-body-lead text-text-primary mb-6">
                            Senior Agile SME and Transformation Coach with a focus on Wealth, Payments, and Healthcare. Expert in sociotechnical design, organizational flow, and high-performing teams.
                        </p>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                            {seniorAgileClusters.map((cluster) => (
                                <div class="bg-surface-card p-5 rounded-lg shadow-xs">
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 text-text-primary">
                                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] text-accent-flow">{cluster.icon}</span>
                                        <h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-semibold">{cluster.title}</h4>
                                    </div>
                                    <ul class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-secondary space-y-2">
                                        {cluster.items.map((item) => (
                                            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-accent-flow">•</span> {item}</li>
                                        ))}
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            ))}
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Agile Coach 2017-2019 -->
                    <div class="relative group">
                        <div class="absolute -left-[23px] md:-left-[35px] top-1.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-text-muted ring-4 ring-surface-page"></div>
                        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-baseline justify-between gap-1 mb-1">
                            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-text-primary">Agile Coach</h3>
                            <span class="font-code-sm text-code-sm text-text-muted">2017 — 2019</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-muted mb-4">Agile by Design • Toronto, Canada</div>
                        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-text-secondary mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                            Agile Coach focused on operating model transformation, quantitative planning, and team coaching within Wealth Management.
                        </p>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
